OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly cloudy in the
OL,6,Fwest with showers or longer spells of
OL,7,Frain, turning heavy and quite
OL,8,Fpersistent at times. Warm in the east
OL,9,Fwith some bright spells and a few
OL,10,Fshowers, locally heavy and thundery.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome evening sunshine in the
OL,13,Feast but cloudy in the west with
OL,14,Foccasionally heavy rain, this
OL,15,Fspreading east to all parts overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
