OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FOccasionally heavy rain soon
OL,6,Fclearing east. Then rather cloudy with
OL,7,Fscattered showers from the west, the
OL,8,Fbest of any dry and bright spells in
OL,9,Fthe east. Temperatures back near
OL,10,Fnormal.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FVariable cloud some bright spells on
OL,14,FSaturday and Sunday with a few light
OL,15,Fshowers. Likely turning wet and windy
OL,16,Fthrough Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
